plugin-qualify (0.14.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: plugin-qualify 0.14.0 (#140, #124)
  * scan.py: walk lilv collections by begin, is_end and next
  * CI: jsonschema comes with the scanners, before any suite runs
  * README: the scanned descriptors, descriptor_dir and the file name
  * Round trip the CLAP fixture set through its scanned descriptors
  * Both scanners write scanned descriptors into descriptor_dir
  * Declare descriptor_dir, the descriptor schema and the descriptor codes
  * clap-qualify scan: each file's SHA-256, audio port types, note port
    dialects
  * audit doc: name the retired code without spelling the hosting token the
    vocabulary conformance reads (#124)
  * ci: run the overlap audit's self-test (#124)
  * audit: plugin-qualify against omx-clap-core's compatibility tests, by the
    numbers (#124)
  * audit-overlap.sh: the audit's own files are never counted (#124)
  * audit-overlap.sh: clap-qualify's scan mode and the probing programs as
    units (#124)
  * audit-overlap.sh: the overlap numbers, found by name, with a self-test
    (#124)

